    <section class="blk next" id="p101" style="grid-row:6 / span 7" data-page="101" data-time="23:10 · Apple TV · P101" aria-labelledby="h-inv">
      <div class="head"><h2 id="h-inv">The Invite</h2><span class="tx d meta"><span>2026</span><span>23:10 – 01:02</span><span>01:52:10</span><span>next</span></span></div>
      <div class="body one">
        <div>
          <h3>How it works · five slots</h3>
          <div class="slots" role="list">
            <div class="r" role="listitem"><div class="when"><span class="tx">00:18:30</span><span class="tx d"><small>slot 1</small></span></div><div class="what"><h3>Notice something</h3></div><div class="how">Keep watching. Afterframe observes the active Plex session on your Apple TV without taking control of it.</div></div>
            <div class="r" role="listitem"><div class="when"><span class="tx">00:18:50</span><span class="tx d"><small>slot 2</small></span></div><div class="what"><h3>Reach back</h3><span class="q">Drag to hold a moment</span></div><div class="how">Move through the recent indexed timeline until you find the frame that caught you, or jump across the full runtime.</div></div>
            <div class="r live" role="listitem"><div class="when"><span class="tx">00:19:40</span><span class="tx d"><small>slot 3</small></span></div><div class="what"><h3>Keep it</h3></div><div class="how">Afterframe secures the frame and its place in the film, then quietly works toward a higher-quality image when one is available.</div></div>
            <div class="r" role="listitem"><div class="when"><span class="tx">Later</span><span class="tx d"><small>slot 4</small></span></div><div class="what"><h3>Make it yours</h3><span class="q">What made you stop here?</span></div><div class="how">Keep the moment as it is, preserve available dialogue, or answer that one question.</div></div>
            <div class="r" role="listitem"><div class="when"><span class="tx">Any time</span><span class="tx d"><small>slot 5</small></span></div><div class="what"><h3>Share it</h3></div><div class="how">Send a clean image to a friend, or include dialogue and timecode when the context matters. The private original stays in Afterframe.</div></div>
