          <p class="tx d" style="margin-top:8px; font-size:12px">Or a durable copy: Marie Antoinette (2006) — 00-05-40.jpg · 1920 × 1080 · stamped · Photos</p>
        </div>
        <div class="phone-row"><figure><div class="phone"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="920" height="2000" src="/shots/afterframe/shots/share-thread.webp" alt="The group thread with the frame between two replies"></div><figcaption class="tx d">The thread · names blurred</figcaption></figure></div>
      </div>
      <div class="body one">
        <div>
          <h3 id="p104" data-page="104">Kept carefully. Exported honestly.</h3>
          <ul class="index">
            <li><span class="k">Source frame</span><span class="s">Secured</span><span class="v">The indexed frame you were shown</span></li>
            <li><span class="k">Enhanced</span><span class="s">Distinct</span><span class="v">A higher-quality frame from your server</span></li>
            <li><span class="k">Subtitles</span><span class="s">Optional</span><span class="v">Text cue, rendered by Afterframe</span></li>
