    </section>
    <div class="kept" style="grid-row:13" data-time="01:10 · kept">
      <figure><span class="pin" aria-hidden="true"></span><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="640" height="382" src="/shots/afterframe/frames/itmfl-08-46-s.jpg" alt="In the Mood for Love, kept at 01:10, 00:08:46 into the film"><figcaption><span class="tx p">01:10</span><span class="tx d">00:08:46 · In the Mood for Love</span><span class="line">No subtitles on this one. The note reads: the mirror, again.</span></figcaption></figure>
